# {{NAME}}

Blender CAD project. Machine contract: `docs/PRINT_SPEC.yaml`.

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `docs/PRINT_SPEC.yaml` | Named parameters, bodies, CAM limits |
| `docs/DESIGN.md` | Optional narrative |
| `src/build.py` | Parametric headless bpy builder |
| `stl/` | One binary STL per independently manufactured body |
| `renders/` | Preview PNGs |
| `scripts/export.sh` | Thin wrapper → pblend |

## Build

```bash
pblend doctor
pblend run --project "$(pwd)"
pblend gate --project "$(pwd)"
pblend preview --project "$(pwd)"
pblend pack --project "$(pwd)" --version {{VERSION}}
```

## Manufacture

Orientation, bed face, and material come from PRINT_SPEC.yaml. HARD fail from `pblend gate` means not done.

